==Quick Walkthrough==
# Read the [[Skyrim:Elder Scroll|Elder Scroll]] at the Throat of the World.
# Learn how to use the [[Skyrim:Dragonrend|Dragonrend]] shout.
# Defeat [[Skyrim:Alduin|Alduin]].

==Detailed Walkthrough==
===The Time-Wound===
As soon as you claim the [[Skyrim:Elder Scroll|Elder Scroll]] from the [[Skyrim:Tower of Mzark|Tower of Mzark]], this quest starts and points you back to the [[Skyrim:Throat of the World|Throat of the World]] where [[Skyrim:Paarthurnax_(dragon)|Paarthurnax]] awaits. Exit the tower by using the lift to the east and pull the handle on the surface, thus providing yet another shortcut to [[Skyrim:Blackreach|Blackreach]]. You will find yourself a long way from [[Skyrim:Alftand|Alftand]] where you initially entered and may wish to loot the abandoned camp just outside the tower entrance. Travel back to the Throat of the World and Paarthurnax will be quite impressed with your efforts: ''"You have it. The Kel - the Elder Scroll. {{hover|Time bends... touch|Tiid kreh... qalos}}. Time shudders at its touch. There is no question. You are doom-driven. {{hover|Blessing (of) Akatosh|Kogaan Akatosh}}. The very [[Lore:Earth Bones|bones of the earth]]s are at your disposal. Go then. Fulfill your destiny. Take the Scroll to the Time-Wound. Do not delay. [[Skyrim:Alduin|Alduin]] will be coming. He cannot miss the signs."''

Make your way a few feet to the northwest and you will see the Time-Wound, an unnatural ripple of air that distorts light passing through it. Go into the middle, find the Elder Scroll in your inventory, and read it: 
